Package: xwayland
Version: @DEB_XWAYLAND_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libwayland0, libxcvt0, libxshmfence1, libdrm2, libpixman-1-0, libxkbcommon0, libxfont2, libfontenc1
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wayland.freedesktop.org/xserver.html
Description: X server for running X11 apps as Wayland clients (iOS/ANGLE)
 Xwayland 23.2 built for rootless iOS. Runs X11-only applications as clients of
 a Wayland compositor (iosc, and later Mutter/KWin) so they work inside every
 Wayland desktop flavor. glamor is GPU-accelerated on ANGLE-Metal: window
 pixmaps are IOSurfaces exported to the compositor over the iosc_iosurface
 protocol (no DRM/gbm/dma-buf on iOS). GLX/desktop-GL apps fall back to
 software (llvmpipe over shared memory); the 2D X render path is accelerated.
